== (c) scale of the warranted benchmark on the swap contrast (synthetic readers, no LLM) ==
reader c=1.5: own pi_C1 0.229 | spec D_full=-pi*delta_bar -0.0212 | actual D_swap under FULL discount -0.0281 (blind +0.00002) | actual/spec 1.32 | G blind +0.0213
reader c=5.0: own pi_C1 0.670 | spec D_full=-pi*delta_bar -0.0622 | actual D_swap under FULL discount -0.0923 (blind +0.00005) | actual/spec 1.49 | G blind +0.0615
analytic: discounting F by delta moves L_A by -pi*delta*(pX-m_-X) and L_B by -pi*delta*(pY-m_-Y); difference = -pi*delta*(5/4)(pX-pY) => D_swap(full) = -1.25*pi*delta (delta weighted by |pX-pY|)
|pX-pY|-weighted delta: 0.09287 vs unweighted delta_bar 0.09284

